  "title": "The Mods, Skad and Drash",
  "description": "The Mods — short for Modifiers — are a cyborg street gang based in the Workers District of Mos Espa. This unruly gang of disgruntled youths are led by Skad and Drash from atop their customized grav scoots. They rally their street gang to work for Boba Fett to improve the lives of everyone across Mos Espa. Alongside the rest of Fett's allies, Skad and Drash work to defend the city against the incursion of the Pykes, keeping an eye cybernetic or otherwise — around the Mos Espa spaceport, waiting to see what the next move of the Pykes will be."
